<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34509" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμ-πρήθω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow up, inflate</i>, of the wind, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δ᾽ ἄνεμος πρῆσεν μέσον ἱστίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.481
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be bloated</i> or <i>swollen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπεπρησμένης ὑός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πρημ-</span> cod. R), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.19.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>burn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέπρηθον μέγα ἄστυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.589
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				1.2.4
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπίμπρημι</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
